00:06:24.360 --> 00:06:27.950
I was worried you might've been done 
for when you got injured, though, Teio!

00:06:27.950 --> 00:06:29.400
You did a good job making it back.

00:06:29.400 --> 00:06:31.570
It's important to never give up.

00:06:32.250 --> 00:06:33.990
So I have to work hard.

00:06:35.550 --> 00:06:36.490
You're right!

00:06:36.490 --> 00:06:38.500
