00:12:11.850 --> 00:12:12.910
So cool!

00:12:12.910 --> 00:12:16.130
McQueen-san... you're so dreamy!

00:12:16.130 --> 00:12:18.450
Ready, and...

00:12:18.450 --> 00:12:20.630
