00:12:19.620 --> 00:12:20.630
...san!

00:12:23.590 --> 00:12:26.020
And now, the star has arrived.

00:12:26.600 --> 00:12:29.780
Seven races, and seven wins: Tokai Teio!

00:12:30.250 --> 00:12:31.750
She certainly looks ready.

00:12:32.100 --> 00:12:34.100
Teio!

00:12:36.100 --> 00:12:37.770
Her aura is amazing!

00:12:37.770 --> 00:12:40.240
Please win, McQueen-san!

00:12:40.240 --> 00:12:42.610
You've got this, Teio-san!

00:12:42.610 --> 00:12:43.890
Ready, and...

00:12:43.890 --> 00:12:45.740
You can do it, Teio!

00:12:44.890 --> 00:12:45.740
...san!

00:12:47.740 --> 00:12:49.870
I don't know if I've ever 
seen a more excited crowd.

00:12:49.870 --> 00:12:51.160
You're right.

00:12:51.160 --> 00:12:53.340
They <i>were</i> excited when 
you were running, Rudolf-chan.

00:12:53.340 --> 00:12:56.630
No, today's response is 
much bigger than mine was.

00:12:56.920 --> 00:13:00.280
I wish I had a rival to
race against, the way they do.

00:13:09.850 --> 00:13:11.820
Who do I root for?

00:13:11.820 --> 00:13:13.180
Both of them, of course!

00:13:13.560 --> 00:13:16.010
<i>I'm gonna outrun everybody today, ultimately!</i>

