00:13:38.570 --> 00:13:40.440
Huh? McQueen-san...

00:13:40.440 --> 00:13:41.550
Is she gonna be okay?

00:13:41.550 --> 00:13:43.410
This has happened before, hasn't it?

00:13:43.410 --> 00:13:44.530
Yeah, I remember.

00:13:44.530 --> 00:13:48.000
It happened to the most popular horse girl
at the time, but she ended up losing after.

00:13:48.000 --> 00:13:49.680
Oh man, I've got a bad feeling about this.

00:13:49.680 --> 00:13:51.490
No bad feelings allowed!

00:13:51.490 --> 00:13:52.680
S-Sorry!

00:13:54.680 --> 00:13:58.260
Don't lose your focus, McQueen!

00:14:02.880 --> 00:14:05.690
Teio's staying calm through the wait, huh?

00:14:05.690 --> 00:14:09.080
This is like the duel between Miyamoto Musashi
 and Sasaki Kojiro at Ganryuu Island.

00:14:09.080 --> 00:14:11.610
Which one is Miyamoto Musashi, in this case?

00:14:12.830 --> 00:14:15.200
Is it Turbo's time to shine?

00:14:17.210 --> 00:14:21.710
It looks like Mejiro McQueen has 
finished with her horseshoe.

00:14:21.710 --> 00:14:25.960
Despite the incident, she doesn't 
seem to have lost her composure.

00:14:26.920 --> 00:14:29.570
The fanfare signaling the start 
of the match of the millennium

00:14:29.570 --> 00:14:31.690
has begun to play throughout 
the Kyoto Racecourse.

00:14:31.690 --> 00:14:33.560
Just who will win?

00:14:33.560 --> 00:14:39.260
Each horse girl enters her gate, 
looking ready to struggle for supremacy.

00:14:39.260 --> 00:14:43.610
And last up is Tokai Teio, 
entering #14 on the outside.

00:14:46.090 --> 00:14:47.720
Teio-san!

00:14:46.780 --> 00:14:48.110
McQueen-san!

00:14:50.360 --> 00:14:55.240
Now, who will leave the Spring 
Tennoushou victorious? The 7-0 Tokai Teio?

00:14:55.240 --> 00:14:58.750
Or the strongest stayer, Mejiro McQueen?

00:14:58.750 --> 00:15:01.670
These 14 horse girls are putting 
their pride on the line...

00:15:02.960 --> 00:15:04.450
And the race has begun!

00:15:02.960 --> 00:15:06.960
<b>Umamusume</b>

00:15:02.960 --> 00:15:06.960
<b><i>Pretty Derby</i></b>

00:15:09.810 --> 00:15:13.100
The horse girls are holding fairly 
tightly together as the race starts off.

00:15:13.100 --> 00:15:14.300
No one is lagging behind.

00:15:14.970 --> 00:15:19.310
Who will set the pace of this 
3,200 meter long distance run?

00:15:19.310 --> 00:15:20.470
Go!

00:15:20.470 --> 00:15:21.190
Which one?!

00:15:21.190 --> 00:15:21.800
Both!

00:15:21.800 --> 00:15:24.920
Will McQueen make the 
first move, or Tokai Teio?

00:15:26.620 --> 00:15:28.740
Oh, and Mejiro Palmer presses 
up from the outside!

00:15:28.740 --> 00:15:30.450
Wha?!

00:15:31.610 --> 00:15:33.950
Mejiro Palmer is now leading the race!

00:15:34.250 --> 00:15:36.090
<i>Ultim-outrun!</i>

00:15:36.090 --> 00:15:37.700
Here we go!

00:15:37.700 --> 00:15:40.610
McQueen is currently hovering 
around 6th and 7th place,

00:15:40.610 --> 00:15:43.350
with Tokai Teio moving into a 
similar position on the outside.

00:15:43.350 --> 00:15:45.210
McQueen is starting to push forward,

00:15:45.210 --> 00:15:48.550
with Tokai Teio holding 
steady slightly behind her.

00:15:48.760 --> 00:15:51.590
<i>Everyone's attention is 
locked on these two,</i>

00:15:51.590 --> 00:15:53.930
<i>who are taking the center 
spotlight at this race!</i>

00:15:53.930 --> 00:15:57.330
A 3,200 course is going to involve 
a lot of sudden shifts in pace.

00:15:57.330 --> 00:16:00.320
It demands a lot of stamina, 
focus, and racing know-how.

00:16:00.320 --> 00:16:01.310
What brought this on?

00:16:01.310 --> 00:16:04.230
There's a tendency to speed up
coming around the fourth corner

00:16:04.230 --> 00:16:06.190
in order to get the crowd on your side.

00:16:06.190 --> 00:16:07.890
But if you fall for that here,

00:16:07.890 --> 00:16:12.160
and blow the stamina needed for the 
final stretch, it won't do any good!

00:16:12.160 --> 00:16:14.660
I guess our cheering is just 
gonna get in the way, huh?

00:16:14.660 --> 00:16:18.820
The horse girls will now be 
passing the front-side stands.

00:16:18.820 --> 00:16:19.910
Here they come!

00:16:19.910 --> 00:16:20.990
McQueen-san!

00:16:20.990 --> 00:16:22.750
Teio-san!

00:16:22.750 --> 00:16:23.790
Go!

00:16:23.790 --> 00:16:26.230
Entering the home stretch of the first lap,

00:16:26.230 --> 00:16:28.980
and they're now passing in 
front of the majority of the seats.

00:16:28.980 --> 00:16:31.750
And the spectators are spurring them on!

00:16:30.260 --> 00:16:33.170
Come on! You can do it!

00:16:33.170 --> 00:16:34.840
Hang in there!

00:16:37.550 --> 00:16:39.930
<i>It's so bumpy! It's hard to run on!</i>

00:16:39.930 --> 00:16:42.600
Looks like the turf's 
gotten completely torn up.

00:16:42.600 --> 00:16:45.650
It takes real power to persevere. I wonder...

00:16:50.910 --> 00:16:53.590
<i>I'll stick behind McQueen during 
the opening and mid game.</i>

00:16:54.020 --> 00:16:57.070
<i>And when we hit the third corner on 
the second lap, I'll make my move!</i>

00:16:57.070 --> 00:16:59.520
The cheers have quieted down a bit,

00:16:59.520 --> 00:17:03.540
as Mejiro Palmer retains the lead,
 pulling the others along.

00:17:04.170 --> 00:17:08.290
<i>I need to get a bigger lead!
 Come on! Dig deep!</i>

00:17:09.070 --> 00:17:12.810
McQueen is currently in 4th place, 
with Tokai Teio in the middle of the pack.

00:17:12.810 --> 00:17:15.710
She's positioned herself so she 
can keep her eyes on Mejiro McQueen.

00:17:15.710 --> 00:17:18.050
<i>I can see McQueen's moves from here!</i>

00:17:20.560 --> 00:17:22.560
Which one is going to strike first?

00:17:22.560 --> 00:17:24.060
Who's it gonna be?!

00:17:24.060 --> 00:17:27.470
Rounding the second corner, 
they have now entered the backstretch.

00:17:27.470 --> 00:17:29.770
With the race reaching its final half,

00:17:29.770 --> 00:17:33.570
focus will be honing in on when 
Mejiro McQueen and Tokai Teio choose

00:17:33.570 --> 00:17:36.070
to enter their final spurt.

00:17:36.070 --> 00:17:38.700
The horse girls are now 
entering the third corner.

00:17:39.840 --> 00:17:42.010
<i>Okay, here we go! Let's do it!</i>

00:17:43.320 --> 00:17:46.660
Oh, and Tokai Teio is on 
the move! There she goes!

00:17:47.180 --> 00:17:48.420
Go!

00:17:48.420 --> 00:17:51.140
The incline of the third corner! This is it!

00:17:51.140 --> 00:17:55.010
But the spring winner's plaque is something 
that last year's winner, Mejiro McQueen,

00:17:55.010 --> 00:17:56.270
has no intention of ceding to another!

00:17:56.270 --> 00:18:00.280
Yet Tokai Teio is determined 
to walk away with it!

00:18:02.680 --> 00:18:05.050
They've now hit the 800 meter mark!

00:18:05.050 --> 00:18:07.710
We're entering unknown territory, 
an all-new distance for Tokai Teio!

00:18:07.710 --> 00:18:10.690
<i>I trained so much! I can do this!</i>

00:18:11.990 --> 00:18:14.690
<i>Don't lose, Teio! Don't lose, McQueen!</i>

00:18:14.690 --> 00:18:18.580
And McQueen is now in the lead!
 She is out in front!

00:18:18.580 --> 00:18:21.320
The horse girls are now 
entering the home stretch!

00:18:21.320 --> 00:18:24.980
Tokai Teio is hot on her tail!
 She's coming after her!

00:18:27.830 --> 00:18:30.330
<i>Nothing's in my way! I can do this!</i>

00:18:30.330 --> 00:18:32.340
<i>Watch me, Prez!</i>

00:18:35.440 --> 00:18:36.800
Teio's going for it!

00:18:36.800 --> 00:18:39.800
Whoa, and Tokai Teio presses even harder!

00:18:52.670 --> 00:18:54.630
<i>Not bad, McQueen!</i>

00:18:54.630 --> 00:18:57.610
<i>But I'm gonna win this!</i>

00:19:05.280 --> 00:19:09.430
<i>I can't move up any further! Why? Why?!</i>

00:19:09.430 --> 00:19:11.520
Is it me, or is she not looking 
as sharp as usual?

00:19:11.520 --> 00:19:12.890
And like she's having a hard time.

00:19:12.890 --> 00:19:14.920
<i>This is where the distance 
is making a difference!</i>

00:19:17.420 --> 00:19:19.530
<i>But I trained so hard!</i>

00:19:25.680 --> 00:19:29.310
<i>I can't lose! I'm going to be undefeated!</i>

00:19:29.660 --> 00:19:31.860
<i>I promised the Prez!</i>

00:19:33.770 --> 00:19:35.650
McQueen!

00:19:35.880 --> 00:19:38.410
McQueen is demonstrating miraculous speed!

00:19:38.410 --> 00:19:40.310
And what's happening to Tokai Teio?

00:19:40.310 --> 00:19:42.250
She's not gaining the way she normally does!

00:19:42.250 --> 00:19:44.080
Currently falling from third to fourth!

00:19:44.080 --> 00:19:48.490
Mejiro McQueen is still in the lead, 
with Kania Curation in second!

00:19:48.490 --> 00:19:52.390
Grace On Dance passes Tokai 
Teio and moves into third,

00:19:52.390 --> 00:19:55.500
but it doesn't look like anyone 
is catching up to Mejiro McQueen!

00:19:59.190 --> 00:20:00.760
She's amazing! More than amazing!

00:20:00.760 --> 00:20:03.990
The best stayer in modern racing,
 Mejiro McQueen!

00:20:03.990 --> 00:20:06.260
Her lead keeps expanding, 
and in first place—

00:20:06.260 --> 00:20:08.010
She crosses the goal!

00:20:08.010 --> 00:20:12.730
For the second time in a row, 
she has won the Spring Tennoushou!

00:20:16.520 --> 00:20:20.030
Mejiro McQueen has asserted her 
unassailable position of power!

00:20:20.600 --> 00:20:21.630
McQueen...

00:20:21.630 --> 00:20:23.140
Teio-san...

00:20:23.140 --> 00:20:24.530
Yay!

00:20:25.290 --> 00:20:26.700
Teio-san...

00:20:27.280 --> 00:20:30.570
I... I can't believe Tokai Teio lost.

00:20:31.560 --> 00:20:33.040
Not bad at all, McQueen!

00:20:33.040 --> 00:20:34.500
She did it!

00:20:47.250 --> 00:20:50.520
<i>I've just never been in a long race before.</i>

00:20:50.830 --> 00:20:53.390
We don't know if I'm any good at it or not.

00:20:53.630 --> 00:20:56.190
You can compensate for 
stamina with training...

00:20:56.190 --> 00:20:59.760
I wasn't able to become an undefeated 
Triple Crown horse girl.

00:20:59.760 --> 00:21:02.400
But I can keep being undefeated!

00:21:07.870 --> 00:21:10.870
<b>K
y
o
t
o</b>

00:21:07.870 --> 00:21:10.870
<b>Results</b>

00:21:32.300 --> 00:21:34.700
If you do lose, please try not to cry.

00:21:40.970 --> 00:21:42.280
McQueen...

00:21:47.240 --> 00:21:50.170
A consecutive Tennoushou... That's amazing.

00:21:52.790 --> 00:21:54.090
Teio...

00:21:54.790 --> 00:21:56.550
It was because of you...

00:21:56.910 --> 00:22:00.530
I'm only where I am today because of you.

00:22:00.530 --> 00:22:01.670
Teio—

00:22:04.580 --> 00:22:06.830
Congratulations, McQueen.

00:22:10.140 --> 00:22:12.120
Thank you, Teio.

00:22:19.940 --> 00:22:22.440
Congratulations, McQueen-san.

00:22:32.120 --> 00:22:34.640
I lost, huh?
